        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55398995?u=9f6a9837c9879eceb0abde487a338b92d4e206fc&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #32946.\">Fix</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2223516993\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/32946\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/32946/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/32946\">#32946</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">It makes a lot of sense to dedupe between them:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>The pages already duplicate a lot</li>\n<li>It more accurately describes the IDL and the real API structure</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">However, BCD cannot be changed because the two interfaces have slightly different support (because XHR landed before the shared <code class=\"notranslate\">XMLHttpRequestEventTarget</code> parent class).</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40882",
            "title": "Move XMLHttpRequestEventTarget events under the interface, dedupe between subclasses",
            "date_modified": "2025-08-25T21:54:59.000Z",
