        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43580235?u=cae42d5a371dd041072ce6d85a1808de05535be8&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The <code class=\"notranslate\">::details-content</code> pseudo-element is now enabled by default.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Bugs</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1941406\" rel=\"nofollow\">Let 'layout.details.force-block-layout:false' and 'layout.css.details-content.enabled:true' ride the trains to release</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Parent issue <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3329636575\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40777\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/40777/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40777\">#40777</a></li>\n</ul>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40872",
            "title": "relnote(Fx143): details-content pseudo is enabled by default",
            "date_modified": "2025-08-25T11:36:17.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-08-25T11:34:17.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "bsmth",
                "url": "https://github.com/bsmth"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47647?u=2fbfc431a85d357f00c0146d5e55b425b7f00a3d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR is part of a series in which I update the Learn area \"Challenge\" articles. In general, they need to be modernized, restructured, and put in better positions in the modules so they are spaced out better and test subjects that have already been covered.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR improves the <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Learn_web_development/Core/Structuring_content/Structuring_a_page_of_content\" rel=\"nofollow\">Structuring a page of content challenge</a>. Specifically, it:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Adds hyperlink and a couple of other content tests to the challenge.</li>\n<li>Modernizes the example (the CSS has been simplified quite a bit), streamlines the question wording, and presents the sample text to work on in the example. In general, the presentation has been made consistent with the new marking up a letter challenge.</li>\n<li>Includes a summary/detail containing the final markup, to allow the reader to self-assess more easily.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n",
