        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7352080?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Add documentation and a release note for <code class=\"notranslate\">browserSetting.verticalTabs</code> introduced by <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1946600\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bug 1946600</a> Add a new browserSetting property that determines whether vertical tabs are enabled.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Browser compatibility data changes are included in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3348542285\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27657\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27657/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27657\">mdn/browser-compat-data#27657</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40864",
            "title": "Bug-1946600 Add webextension.api.browserSetting.verticalTabs documentation and release note",
