        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69888?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Clarified the definition of the 'form' property to include all form-associated elements.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">the form attribute property page is in the works, so may appear red. <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3327682986\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40760\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/40760/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40760\">#40760</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40842",
            "title": "Update HTMLLabelElement 'form' property",
            "date_modified": "2025-08-22T10:38:55.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-08-22T10:36:55.000Z",
            "author": {
