        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69888?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Added details about the elements included in the HTMLFormControlsCollection.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The elements IDL attribute must return an <a href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/common-dom-interfaces.html#htmlformcontrolscollection\" rel=\"nofollow\">HTMLFormControlsCollection</a> rooted at the <a href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/forms.html#the-form-element\" rel=\"nofollow\">form</a> element's <a href=\"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-root\" rel=\"nofollow\">root</a>, whose filter matches <a href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/forms.html#category-listed\" rel=\"nofollow\">listed elements</a> whose <a href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/form-control-infrastructure.html#form-owner\" rel=\"nofollow\">form owner</a> is the <a href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/forms.html#the-form-element\" rel=\"nofollow\">form</a> element, with the exception of <a href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/input.html#the-input-element\" rel=\"nofollow\">input</a> elements whose <a href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/input.html#attr-input-type\" rel=\"nofollow\">type</a> attribute is in the <a href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/input.html#image-button-state-(type=image)\" rel=\"nofollow\">Image Button</a> state, which must, for historical reasons, be excluded from this particular collection.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">related to <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3327682986\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40760\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/40760/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40760\">#40760</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40841",
            "title": "Enhance HTMLFormControlsCollection description",
            "date_modified": "2025-08-22T10:37:48.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-08-22T10:01:24.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "estelle",
                "url": "https://github.com/estelle"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7352080?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Documents that change is made in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1960011\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bug 1960011</a> Filter tabs.onUpdated events by cookieStoreId including a release note and update to the API documentation.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related BCD changes in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3344085777\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27643\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27643/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27643\">mdn/browser-compat-data#27643</a>.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40838",
            "title": "Bug-1960011 filter tabs.onUpdated results by cookieStoreId",
            "date_modified": "2025-08-22T04:16:44.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-08-22T02:51:28.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "rebloor",
                "url": "https://github.com/rebloor"
            }
