        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47647?u=2fbfc431a85d357f00c0146d5e55b425b7f00a3d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Chrome 139 updates the <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/RTCEncodedAudioFrame/getMetadata\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">RTCEncodedAudioFrame.getMetadata()</code></a> method so that the <a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/webrtc-encoded-transform/#dom-rtcencodedaudioframemetadata-audiolevel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">audioLevel</code></a> property is available in its return object. See <a href=\"https://chromestatus.com/feature/5206106602995712\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://chromestatus.com/feature/5206106602995712</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR adds content for this new return property.</p>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n",
